{"line":"T64.C.03","text":"Schneller Takeoff heißt ein oder zwei Jahre, vor allem durch Software getrieben: bessere Algorithmen, viele Kopien und KI, die KI-Forschung betreibt. Das scheint mir viel plausibler, vielleicht 25 bis 35 % in diesem Jahrzehnt. Von innen sieht nichts daran wie eine Explosion aus. Es fühlt sich nur so an, als wäre jeder Monat seltsamer als der letzte.","lufs":-19.02,"alignment":{"characters":["S","c","h","n","e","l","l","e","r"," ","T","a","k","e","o","f","f"," ","h","e","i","ß","t"," ","e","i","n"," ","o","d","e","r"," ","z","w","e","i"," ","J","a","h","r","e",","," ","v","o","r"," ","a","l","l","e","m"," ","d","u","r","c","h"," ","S","o","f","t","w","a","r","e"," ","g","e","t","r","i","e","b","e","n",":"," ","b","e","s","s","e","r","e"," ","A","l","g","o","r","i","t","h","m","e","n",","," ","v","i","e","l","e"," ","K","o","p","i","e","n"," ","u","n","d"," ","K","I",","," ","d","i","e"," ","K","I","-","F","o","r","s","c","h","u","n","g"," ","b","e","t","r","e","i","b","t","."," ","D","a","s"," ","s","c","h","e","i","n","t"," ","m","i","r"," ","v","i","e","l"," ","p","l","a","u","s","i","b","l","e","r",","," ","v","i","e","l","l","e","i","c","h","t"," ","2","5"," ","b","i","s"," ","3","5"," ","%"," ","i","n"," ","d","i","e","s","e","m"," ","J","a","h","r","z","e","h","n","t","."," ","V","o","n"," ","i","n","n","e","n"," ","s","i","e","h","t"," ","n","i","c","h","t","s"," ","d","a","r","a","n"," ","w","i","e"," ","e","i","n","e"," ","E","x","p","l","o","s","i","o","n"," ","a","u","s","."," ","E","s"," ","f","ü","h","l","t"," ","s","i","c","h"," ","n","u","r"," ","s","o"," ","a","n",","," ","a","l","s"," ","w","ä","r","e"," ","j","e","d","e","r"," ","M","o","n","a","t"," ","s","e","l","t","s","a","m","e","r"," ","a","l","s"," ","d","e","r"," ","l","e","t","z","t","e","."],"character_start_times_seconds":[0,0.08,0.107,0.133,0.16,0.208,0.256,0.304,0.352,0.4,0.48,0.56,0.64,0.72,0.8,0.853,0.907,0.96,1.024,1.088,1.152,1.216,1.28,1.44,1.48,1.52,1.56